{"id":144,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"This Pokémon can control ice at will. Articuno is said to live in snowy mountains riddled with permafrost."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s said that this Pokémon’s beautiful blue wings are made of ice. Articuno flies over snowy mountains, its long tail fluttering along behind it."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It freezes water that is contained in winter air and makes it snow."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Emerald","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Articuno is a legendary bird Pokémon that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this Pokémon flies, snow will fall."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"A legendary bird Pokémon that is said to appear to doomed people who are lost in icy mountains."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon, it chills moisture in the atmosphere to create snow while flying."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"The magnificent, seemingly translucent wings of this legendary bird Pokémon are said to be made of ice."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"One of the legendary bird POKéMON. With its long tail trailing behind, its flying form is magnificent."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Legendary bird POKéMON. As it flies through the sky, it cools the air, causing snow to fall."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pressure","hidden":false,"description":"Puts other Pokémon under pressure, causing them to expend more PP to use their moves."},{"name":"Snow Cloak","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in snow."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":80,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rare","color":"Blue","shape":